|   body row 1                        | colum 2           |        |
|   body row 2                        |                   | column |
+-------------------------------------+-------------------+--------+


======================          ===============         ===================
    header1                         header2                 header3
----------------------          ---------------         -------------------
    data1                           data2                   data3
======================          ===============         ===================


